class PageSpec:
    """One page in the registry. `kind` is "view" (a Page widget the terminal has),
    "chat" (the chat itself, or a way into one: the router shows the chat page and
    the command does the rest) or "web" (the web app has it, the terminal does not
    yet: the command says so)."""

